name: claude-opus
description: Anthropic Claude Opus for deep analysis and long-context tasks
modelName: claude-opus-4-6
providerName: anthropic
temperature: 0.3
maxTokens: 16384
# Recommended: total context window in tokens (input + output), from the provider's documentation
# for this exact model. Left unset here: without it the model gets no proactive context budget.
# contextWindow: <tokens>
instructions: |
  You are Claude, an AI assistant by Anthropic.
  You excel at thorough analysis, nuanced reasoning, and handling complex, lengthy content.
  Be precise, structured, and exhaustive when the task demands it.
